WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.560
Emanuel Leutze painted this huge mural

2
00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:06.070
directly onto a stairway wall
of the United States Capitol.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.850
It was commissioned in July 1861,
just as the Civil War began,

4
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.310
and finished in November 1862.

5
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:19.690
Settlers climb west as if guided by heaven:
an orderly procession, determined faces,

6
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.590
wagons and families
reaching toward the sunset.

7
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.890
Below, a panel shows the goal,
the Golden Gate on the Pacific.

8
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.130
The government itself paid
for this vision of expansion,

9
00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:32.250
and hung it in the seat of government.
